<div style="height:0;overflow:hidden"><input type="submit" title="submit"  disabled></div><div  class="Section"  data-gx-base-lib="bootstrapv3" data-abstract-form ><div id="LAYOUTMAINTABLE_MPAGE"  class="MainContainerWithFooter" ><div  class="row" ><div  class="col-xs-12" ><div id="TABLEMAIN_MPAGE"  class="Table" ><div  class="row" ><div  class="col-xs-12" ><div id="TABLEMAIN1_MPAGE"  class="Table" ><div  class="row" ><div  class="col-xs-12 MasterHeaderCellLandingCongo" ><div id="TABLEHEADERFIXWIDTH_MPAGE"  class="TableContentLandingCongo" ><div  class="row" ><div  class="col-xs-12 CellPaddingLeftRight0XS" ><div id="TABLEHEADER_MPAGE"  class="Flex"  data-gx-flex ><div  style="align-self:flex-start;"  classref ><img src="Resources/FormLogo.png" data-gx-evt="7" id="LOGOHEADER_MPAGE" data-gx-readonly  alt="" class="ImageTop logo-moveL ImageTop1 GX_Image_FormLogo_Class"  data-gx-image   onfocus="gx.evt.onfocus(this, 17,'',true,'',0)"/></div><div  class="CellPaddingLeftRight0XS CellPaddingLeft30 HorizontalMenuCell"  style="flex-grow:1;" ><div class="gx_usercontrol" id="UCMENU_MPAGEContainer"></div></div><div  class="CellHeaderBar hidden-xs" ><div id="TABLEUSERROLE_MPAGE"  class="Flex"  style="display:none;align-items:flex-end;"  data-gx-flex ><div  class="MasterTopIconsCell" ><div class="gx_usercontrol" id="DDC_ADMINAG_MPAGEContainer"></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div  class="row" ><div id="TABLETITLECELL_MPAGE"  class="col-xs-12 CellTitleMasterLandingCongo" ><div id="TABLETITLE_MPAGE"  class="Table" ><div  class="row" ><div  class="col-xs-12" ><span class="TextBlockTitleMaster"  style="display:none;"  id="TEXTBLOCKTITLE_MPAGE" > Title </span></div></div><div  class="row" ><div  class="col-xs-12" ><div class="TextBlock"  style="display:none;"  id="SUBTITLE_MPAGE"  data-gxformat="1" >Developer Menu > Person</div></div></div></div></div></div><div  class="row" ><div  class="col-xs-12" ><div id="TABLECONTENT_MPAGE"  class="Table" ><div  class="row" ><div id="CONTENTHOLDERCELL_MPAGE"  class="col-xs-12 CellTableContentHorizontalMenu" ><div class="gx-content-placeholder" ><div class="gx-ct-body form-horizontal Form-fx" ><div  class="Section"  data-gx-base-lib="bootstrapv3" data-abstract-form ><div id="LAYOUTMAINTABLE"  class="Table" ><div  class="row" ><div  class="col-xs-12" ><div id="TABLEMAIN"  class="TableMain TableMain_MT" ><div  class="row" ><div  class="col-xs-12 TB-bnpd0" ><div id="BANNER"  class="BN-img" ><div  class="row" ><div  class="col-xs-12" ><div id="UNNAMEDTABLE4"  class="TableContentLandingCongo tx-s" ><div  class="row" ><div  class="col-xs-12 tb-bnpos" ><span class="tb-bnfont"  id="TB_BANNER" >Find a Registered PIE auditor</span></div></div><div  class="row" ><div  class="col-xs-12" ><table id="UNNAMEDTABLE5" class="Table"  data-cellpadding="1" data-cellspacing="2"><tr><td><div class="TBBackTxt"  style="display:inline;"  id="TB_BACK0"  data-gxformat="1" >Home</div></td><td><div class="TBBackTxt TBBackSP"  style="display:inline;"  id="TB_BACKSP1"  data-gxformat="1" > / </div></td><td><div class="TBBackTxt"  style="display:inline;"  id="TB_BACK1"  data-gxformat="1" >Find a Registered PIE auditor</div></td></tr></table></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div  class="row" ><div  class="col-xs-12 marginTB" ><div id="TABLECONTENT"  class="TableContentLandingCongo" ><div  class="row" ><div  class="col-xs-12" ><div><span class="ErrorViewer gx_ev ErrorViewerBullet"  data-gx-id="gxErrorViewer"></span></div></div></div><div  class="row" ><div  class="col-xs-12 CellPaddingBottom" ><div id="TABLEHEADER"  class="Flex"  style="display:none;flex-direction:column;"  data-gx-flex ><div  style="flex-grow:1;"  classref ><div id="TABLEHEADERCONTENT"  class="Flex"  style="flex-wrap:wrap;"  data-gx-flex ><div  style="flex-grow:1;"  classref ><div id="TABLEACTIONS"  class="Flex"  data-gx-flex ><div  style="align-self:center;"  classref ><span class="TextBlockTitleWWP"  id="TEXTBLOCKTITLE" >Find a Registered PIE auditor</span></div></div></div><div  classref ><div id="TABLERIGHTHEADER"  class="Flex"  style="flex-wrap:wrap;"  data-gx-flex ><div  class="CellAlignTopPaddingTop2"  style="flex-grow:1;" ><div class="gx_usercontrol" id="DDO_MANAGEFILTERSContainer"></div></div><div  style="flex-grow:1;"  classref ></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div  class="row" ><div  class="col-xs-12 hidden-xs hidden-sm hidden-md hidden-lg" ><span class="tb-bnfont2"  id="TEXTBLOCK1" >Find a Registered PIE auditor</span></div></div><div  class="row" ><div  class="col-xs-12" ><div class="Attribute TextBlock16px txt_Jtf tb_black"  style="display:inline;"  id="TEXTBLOCK2"  data-gxformat="1" ><p>Under the Accounting and Financial Reporting Council Ordinance (Cap. 588), a local auditor intending to carry out a public interest entity (<strong>PIE</strong>) engagement is required to be registered with the Accounting and Financial Reporting Council (<strong>AFRC</strong>) as a registered PIE auditor. It is an offence for a local auditor to undertake (i.e. accept an appointment for carrying out) or carry out any PIE engagement, or to hold out as a registered PIE auditor, without being registered as a registered PIE auditor.</p></div></div></div><div  class="row" ><div  class="col-xs-12" ><div id="UNNAMEDTABLE1"  class="Table"  style="height:10px;" ></div></div></div><div  class="row" ><div  class="col-xs-12" ><div class="Attribute TextBlock16px txt_Jtf tb_black"  style="display:inline;"  id="TEXTBLOCK6"  data-gxformat="1" ><p>The register of registered PIE auditors is published by the AFRC for the purpose of enabling the public to ascertain whether they are dealing with a PIE auditor registered with the AFRC or a registered responsible person of such a PIE auditor and to ascertain their particulars. Any personal data or other data contained in the register of registered PIE auditors must not be used for any non-directly related purposes. It is a criminal offence under the Personal Data (Privacy) Ordinance (Cap. 486) to use the personal data in the register of registered PIE auditors for direct marketing without the data subjects' consent.</p></div></div></div><div  class="row" ><div  class="col-xs-12" ><div id="UNNAMEDTABLE2"  class="Table"  style="height:10px;" ></div></div></div><div  class="row" ><div  class="col-xs-12" ><div class="Attribute TextBlock16px txt_Jtf tb_black"  style="display:inline;"  id="TEXTBLOCK7"  data-gxformat="1" ><p>Whilst the AFRC has taken all reasonable steps to ensure the accuracy of the entries, it accepts no responsibility for any errors or omissions in the register of registered PIE auditors.</p></div></div></div><div  class="row" ><div  class="col-xs-12" ><span class="TextBlock"  id="TEXTBLOCK5" >  </span></div></div><div  class="row" ><div  class="col-xs-12" ><div id="TABLE_SEARCH"  class="Table" ><div  class="row" ><div  class="col-xs-12" ><div  class="form-group gx-form-group"  data-gx-for="vNAME"><label  class="gx-label col-sm-3 AttributeLabel input_widthLabel control-label" for="vNAME">English name:</label><div  class="col-sm-9 gx-attribute" ><input type="text" id="vNAME" name="vNAME" value="" size="80" placeholder="Name of the auditor (in English)" spellcheck="true" maxlength="100" class="Attribute input_width"  style="text-align:left"   onfocus="gx.evt.onfocus(this, 74,'',false,'0001',0)" onchange=";gx.evt.onchange(this, event)"  onblur=";gx.evt.onblur(this,74);"/></div></div></div></div><div  class="row" ><div  class="col-xs-12" ><div  class="form-group gx-form-group"  data-gx-for="vCHINESENAME"><label  class="gx-label col-sm-3 AttributeLabel input_widthLabel control-label" for="vCHINESENAME">Chinese name:</label><div  class="col-sm-9 gx-attribute" ><input type="text" id="vCHINESENAME" name="vCHINESENAME" value="" size="80" placeholder="Name of the auditor (in Chinese)" spellcheck="true" maxlength="100" class="Attribute input_width"  style="text-align:left"   onfocus="gx.evt.onfocus(this, 79,'',false,'0001',0)" onchange=";gx.evt.onchange(this, event)"  onblur=";gx.evt.onblur(this,79);"/></div></div></div></div><div  class="row" ><div  class="col-xs-12" ><div  class="form-group gx-form-group"  data-gx-for="vREGNO"><label  class="gx-label col-sm-3 AttributeLabel input_widthLabel control-label" for="vREGNO">Registration number:</label><div  class="col-sm-9 gx-attribute" ><input type="text" id="vREGNO" name="vREGNO" value="" size="40" placeholder="Practice Unit No." spellcheck="true" maxlength="40" class="Attribute input_width"  style="text-align:left"   onfocus="gx.evt.onfocus(this, 84,'',false,'0001',0)" onchange=";gx.evt.onchange(this, event)"  onblur=";gx.evt.onblur(this,84);"/></div></div></div></div><div  class="row" ><div  class="col-xs-12" ><table id="TABLEMERGEDBTNUA_SEARCH" class="TableMerged"  data-cellpadding="0" data-cellspacing="0"><tr><td class='MergeDataCell'><input type="button" data-gx-button name="BTNUA_SEARCH" id="BTNUA_SEARCH" value="Search" title="Search" class="Button"  data-gx-evt="5"   onfocus="gx.evt.onfocus(this, 90,'',false,'',0)"/></td><td><input type="button" data-gx-button name="BTNUA_RESET" id="BTNUA_RESET" value="Reset" title="Reset" class="BtnDefault"  data-gx-evt="5"   onfocus="gx.evt.onfocus(this, 92,'',false,'',0)"/></td></tr></table></div></div></div></div></div><div  class="row" ><div  class="col-xs-12" ><div class="hr_block"  style="display:inline;"  id="TEXTBLOCK4"  data-gxformat="1" ><hr></div></div></div><div  class="row" ><div  class="col-xs-12" ><div id="UNNAMEDTABLE3"  class="Table" ><div  class="row" ><div  class="col-xs-12" ><table id="TABLEMERGEDTEXTBLOCK3" class="TableMerged"  data-cellpadding="0" data-cellspacing="0"><tr><td class='MergeDataCell'><span class="Attribute TextBlock16px ExtendedComboNewOption"  id="TEXTBLOCK3" >Total record(s):</span></td><td><div  class="gx-attribute" ><label  class="gx-label gx-form-item AttributeLabel ExtendedComboNewOptionLabel control-label" for="vTOTAL" data-gx-sr-only 
